        "command": "ip route 2.2.2.2 255.255.255.255 GigabitEthernet1/0/0 10.1.1.2",
        "explanation": "配置静态路由，目的地址为 2.2.2.2/32，下一跳为 10.1.1.2，出接口为 GigabitEthernet1/0/0",
